{"availability":"available","full":"eyavuz21/bonebot","name":"bonebot","description":"Hormone-aware bone-health screening for postmenopausal women: turns a health profile into a T-score estimate with uncertainty range and a DXA-scan prompt when needed. NHANES-trained model predicts, LLM only explains. Next.js/TypeScript, Supabase. Live demo in README. (Winner, Hack-Nation's 6th Global AI Hackathon, Women's Hormonal Health, 2026)","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-30T09:51:07Z","updated":"2026-08-30T09:52:40Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://bonebot.vercel.app","topics":["digital-health","hackathon","healthcare","machine-learning","nextjs","osteoporosis","womens-health"],"demo":"https://bonebot.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.247Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.247Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.247Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.247Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🏆 Winner, Hack-Nation's 6th Global AI Hackathon, London hub.","BoneBot is a hormone-aware bone-health screening assistant for postmenopausal women. It turns a woman's health profile (menopause history, risk factors, and simple labs) into an estimated T-score with an uncertainty range, the factors driving it, and a clear prompt to confirm with a DXA scan when warranted. It is a screening flag, never a diagnosis: an NHANES-trained model makes every prediction, and the LLM only explains it in plain language.","Built in 24 hours for the Hack-Nation 6th Global AI Hackathon: Challenge 05, Women's Hormonal Health."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eyavuz21/bonebot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aa9cc36d179d98062f367744afa80812cae0307fe195e195c3ee50055d677fa9","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.351Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.351Z","projectInsights":{"version":